7. She once believed the idea of dogs reacting to squirrels like in the movie *Up* was fictional, but now finds it accurate. (Verbatim: "I remember watching Up thinking, Hey, funny dogs. Aren't like that though. And then now I have dog and I'm like, damn accurate.")
8. She has a habit of napping heavily and occasionally sleeping most of a day to catch up on sleep. (Verbatim: "I think I finally paid off my sleep debt, I spent yesterday mostly asleep.")
